.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, תְּשֵׁסְרֵי 1\">תְּשֵׁסְרֵי</a> <i>nineteen</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Genesis.11.25\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Genesis 11:25\">Targ. Gen. XI, 25</a> (Y. ed. Vien. <span dir=\"rtl\">שתסרי</span>, corr. acc.). <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Joshua.19.38\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Joshua 19:38\">Targ. Josh. XIX, 38</a>; a. e.—Ber. l. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תמני סרי תקון תשסרי וכ׳</span> eighteen benedictions they introduced, nineteen they did not; a. e.—<a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_תְּשֵׁיסַר.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, תְּשֵׁיסַר 1\">תְּשֵׁיסְרָאָה</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשֵׁסְ׳</span> <i>the nineteenth</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_of_I_Chronicles.24.16\" data-ref=\"Targum of I Chronicles 24:16\">Targ. I Chr. XXIV, 16</a>."}], "morphology": "m."}, "plural_form": [], "alt_headwords": ["תִּשְׁעָא", "תִּשְׁעָה"], "quotes": [], "prev_hw": "תֵּשַׁע", "next_hw": "תִּשְׁעָה", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Jastrow Dictionary", "language": "heb.talmudic", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Jastrow Dictionary", "attribution": "Rabbi Marcus Jastrow", "index_title": "Jastrow", "version_title": "London, Luzac, 1903", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "תִּשְׁעָה", "parent_lexicon": "Jastrow Dictionary", "rid": "V01107", "refs": ["Jastrow, תְּשַׁע 1"], "content": {"senses": [{"definition": ", v. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_תְּשַׁע.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, תְּשַׁע 1\">preced.</a>, a. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_תֵּשַׁע.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, תֵּשַׁע 1\">תֵּשַׁע</a>."}]}, "quotes": [], "prev_hw": "תְּשַׁע", "next_hw": "תַּשְׂקוּפִים", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Jastrow Dictionary", "language": "heb.talmudic", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Jastrow Dictionary", "attribution": "Rabbi Marcus Jastrow", "index_title": "Jastrow", "version_title": "London, Luzac, 1903", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "תִּשְׁעָה", "parent_lexicon": "Klein Dictionary", "content": {"morphology": "m. adj.", "senses": [{"definition": "nine."}]}, "rid": "V01363", "refs": ["Klein Dictionary, תשׁע ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תשׁע ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תשׁע ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, תשׁע ᴵ 1"], "prev_hw": "תשׁע ᴵᴵ", "next_hw": "תִּשְׁעִים", "notes": "[See <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_תשׁע ᴵ.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, תשׁע ᴵ 1\">תֵּשַׁע</a>.]", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Klein Dictionary", "language": "heb.modern", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Klein Dictionary", "attribution": "Ezra Klein", "index_title": "Klein Dictionary", "version_title": "Carta Jerusalem; 1st edition, 1987", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "תֵּ֫שַׁע", "parent_lexicon": "BDB Dictionary", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong>n.m. et. f.</strong> a nine, nonad <strong>(</strong>NH = BH; Assyrian <em>tišit</em> (fem.), <em>nine</em>, <em>tešû</em>, <em>ninth;</em> Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">תסעת</span> <em>nine</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תסעי</span> <em>ninety</em> Hom<sup>Chr 48</sup>; Liḥy. <span dir=\"rtl\">תסע</span> DHM<sup>Epigr. Denkm. Ar. 52</sup>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">تِسْعٌ</span>, Ethiopic ትስዑ Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשַׁע</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܬܫܰܥ</span>, Nab. Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">תשע</span> Lzb<sup>388</sup>, Mand. (<span dir=\"rtl\">א</span> for ע; sometimes ע pref.) <span dir=\"rtl\">תשא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עשתא</span> Nö<sup>M 188</sup>, all <em>nine</em><strong>)</strong>;—<strong>m.</strong> c. <strong>n.f.</strong> abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּ֫שַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">Dt 3:11</a> + 20 times, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:3\" href=\"/Judges.4.3\">Ju 4:3</a> + 18 times; <strong>f.</strong> c. <strong>n.m.</strong> abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.8\">2 S 14:8</a> + 13 times, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁעַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:7\" href=\"/Joshua.13.7\">Jos 13:7</a> + 2 times (these include 9 + 10 = 19);—<em>nine</em> (Hex chiefly P);"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "no other num.:"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "before n.pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּ֫שַׁע אַמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">Dt 3:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ שָׁנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.1\">2 K 17:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:19\" href=\"/Genesis.11.19\">Gn 11:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ הַיָּדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.1\">Ne 11:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁעָה חֳדָשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.8\">2 S 24:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁעַת הַשְּׁבָטִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:7\" href=\"/Joshua.13.7\">Jos 13:7</a> (JE?), cf.<a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:2\" href=\"/Joshua.14.2\">14:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:13\" href=\"/Numbers.34.13\">Nu 34:13</a> (both P); after n.pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרִים תֵּ֫שַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:44\" href=\"/Joshua.15.44\">Jos 15:44</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:51\" href=\"/Joshua.15.51\">51</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:16\" href=\"/Joshua.21.16\">21:16</a> (all P), <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרִים תִּשְׁעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 29:26\" href=\"/Numbers.29.26\">Nu 29:26</a> (P); n. om. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.8\">1 Ch 3:8</a>."}], "num": "a."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "= ordin. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתִשְׁעָה לַחֹדֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.3\">2 K 25:3</a> + 3 times <em>on the ninth</em> (day) <em>of the month;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת־תֵּשַׁע לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.10\">18:10</a> <em>the ninth year of</em>."}], "num": "b."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "9 + 10 = 19, c. <strong>n.f.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשַׁע־עֶשְׂרֵה שָׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:25\" href=\"/Genesis.11.25\">Gn 11:25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרִים תְּשַׁע־עֶשְׂרֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:38\" href=\"/Joshua.19.38\">Jos 19:38</a> (both P), as ordinal <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת תְּשַׁע־עֶשְׂרִים שָׁנָה לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.8\">2 K 25:8</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.12\">Je 52:12</a>; c. <strong>n.m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁעָה עָשָׂר אִישׂ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.30\">2 S 2:30</a>, cf.(as ordin., <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹרָל</span> om.) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.16\">1 Ch 24:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.26\">25:26</a>."}], "num": "2."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "900 = <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשַׁע מֵאוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:3\" href=\"/Judges.4.3\">Ju 4:3</a> + 14 times"}], "num": "3."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "c. tens (20, 30, etc.): <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> foll. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.2\">2 K 14:2</a> + 10 times, precedes <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:24\" href=\"/Genesis.11.24\">Gn 11:24</a> + 6 times, cf.Kö<sup>ii. 1. 215 ff.</sup>"}], "num": "4."}]}, "rid": "BDB11013", "strong_numbers": ["8672"], "next_hw": "תְּשִׁיעִי", "prev_hw": "תֻּשִׁיָּה", "alt_headwords": [{"word": "תִּשְׁעָה", "occurences": "58"}], "quotes": [], "GK": ["9596"], "TWOT": ["2550"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Dictionary", "language": "heb.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}]